    model differences: mine signed V_disk|V_disk|, V_bul|V_bul| vs CFG186 V^2 (identical when V >= 0); g_bar floor 1e-16 m/s^2 vs S >= 1e-6 (km/s)^2; kpc = 3.0856776e19 vs 3.0857e19 m (7e-6 relative).
